{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04864","headline":"奉和张岳州王潭州别诗二首 一 · 韦嗣立","name":"奉和张岳州王潭州别诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茂先王佐才，作牧楚江隈。\n登楼正欲赋，复遇仲宣来。\n黄鹄飞将远，雕龙文爲开。\n宁知昔联事，听曲有余哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦嗣立","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04864.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04864","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}